  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate change is a major challenge in the production systems used to grow rice that needs also to cope with the increased demand of rice supply.  The project will develop understanding of the genetic resources usable in breeding programs to create varieties for adaptation to climate change.</narrative>
